flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[User logs in]
    B --> C[Open Dataset Module]
    C --> D{Upload new data?}
    D -- Yes --> E[Submit dataset to API]
    E --> F[Validate and store rows]
    D -- No --> G[Load existing dataset]
    F --> H[Request analysis]
    G --> H

    H --> I[Compute frequency, year-wise trend,
    platform stats, WCAG pass/fail]
    I --> J[Display charts and summaries]

    J --> K{Need recommendation?}
    K -- Yes --> L[User selects input color]
    L --> M[System computes contrast with
    white and black text]
    M --> N[Return suggested text color + WCAG status]
    K -- No --> O[View/export results]
    N --> O

    O --> P([End])

